Description: Estimates capture probabilities and densities from multipass
  removal (electrofishing) data, following Millar et al. (2016)
  <doi:10.1016/j.fishres.2016.01.001>. Capture probability is modelled on
  the logit scale using fixed effects, penalised smooth terms and random
  effects, for example for between visit and between sample variation. The
  likelihood is computed using 'RTMB', with random effects integrated out
  using the Laplace approximation.
URL: https://faskally.github.io/ef/, https://github.com/Faskally/ef
BugReports: https://github.com/Faskally/ef/issues
